  "versionNotes": [
    {
      "edition": "C# 13 and C# 14",
      "items": [
        "C# 13 extended params parameters from arrays to supported collection types and introduced partial properties and indexers for source-generator scenarios.",
        "C# 14 adds the contextual field keyword in property accessors and extension blocks for extension properties, operators, and static extension members. C# 13 adds implicit index access using the ^ from-end operator in object initializers.",
        "C# 15 adds extension indexers. Indexers are instance members, so an extension indexer declaration names its receiver."
      ],
